+-- reason this file exists: the request that accepted the job ended long before the attempt runs —
+-- minutes, hours, in another process, on another host — so the only thing that can carry a context
+-- across the queue is the row the work is on. A context that travelled in memory would propagate
+-- beautifully in every test and lose the trace in every deployment.
